<title>USA: Western Atlas completes Sungroup purchase.</title>
<headline>Western Atlas completes Sungroup purchase.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Atlas Inc on Friday said it has completed the acquisition of Sungroup Energy Services Co, a leading Canadian well-logging, production testing and completion services provider.</p>
<p>Financial details of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Sungroup had revenues of about C$45 million in 1996. Its acquisition will enable Western Atlas to expand in the Canadian oil and gas market, which with about 12,700 completed wells in 1996 is the second largest single market for well completions in the world.</p>
</text>
